Floorplan
https://github.com/haydenschmitty/floorplan

internal/floorplan derives from Floorplan: its two document schemas
(floorplan/architecture@1 and floorplan/graph@1), its file classification rules
and the regular expressions behind them, its area-assignment precedence, and
its definition of the signature a file description depends on. The
implementation is new Go code, but the design and the rules it encodes are
Floorplan's, and the two produce the same measurements of the same repository.

